@startuml sequence-portfolio
title GET /api/v1/accounts/{id}/portfolio
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor Client
participant "PortfolioController" as PC
participant "PortfolioService" as PS
participant "PortfolioDao" as PD
participant "AssetDao" as AsD
database "SQL Server" as DB

Client -> PC: GET /api/v1/accounts/1/portfolio
PC -> PS: getPortfolio(1)
PS -> PD: findHoldings(1)
PD -> DB: SELECT FROM vw_portfolio_holdings\nWHERE account_id = 1
note over PD, DB: View aggregates BUY/SELL\ninto net quantity
DB --> PD: holding rows
PD --> PS: List Holding
PS -> AsD: enrich each holding with asset details
note over AsD: Asset Stock ETF Bond CryptoAsset
AsD -> DB: SELECT FROM assets + asset_details
DB --> AsD: List Asset
AsD --> PS: List Asset
PS --> PC: PortfolioResponse\ncashBalance holdings totals USD
PC --> Client: 200 OK

note right of Client
  **What this shows**
  How GET /api/v1/accounts/1/portfolio works.
  The service queries a SQL view that aggregates
  buys minus sells into net quantity per asset.
  Each holding is enriched with current asset details.
  The response includes cash, holdings, and total account value (USD).
end note

@enduml
